hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"221","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke ham Eidul Fitr aur Eidul Azha ke din kunwari ladkiyon, haiza aur parda nasheen auraton ko nikalen. Rahi haiza to woh namazgah se alag rahen aur khair aur Musalmanon ki dua mein hazir hon."
"222","[AI-translation] Hisham ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki."
"223","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke ham donon Eidon mein parda nasheen aur haiza auraton ko nikalen; to woh Musalmanon ke sath un ki dua aur un ki namaz mein hazir hon, aur haiza namaz se alag rahen."
"224","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke ham donon Eidon mein kunwari ladkiyon, haiza aur parda nasheen auraton ko nikalen. Rahi haiz waliyan to beshak woh namazgah ke qareeb hon, Musalmanon ki dua mein hazir hon."
"225","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham mein se ek ke paas jilbab nahin hoti. Aap ne farmaya: 'Use us ki bahan apne jilbab mein se pahnae.' Abu Ya'qub ne kaha: Yani donon Eidon mein nikalne mein."
"226","[AI-translation] Hisham ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki."
"227","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Rawahah ki bahan se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Har kamarband wali par nikalna wajib hai' — yani donon Eidon mein."
"228","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon Eidain padhain, phir khutba diya. Aur Abu Bakr ne aise hi padhi, phir khutba diya. Aur Umar ne aise hi padhi, phir khutba diya. Aur Usman ne aise hi padhi, phir khutba diya — baghair azan aur iqamat ke. Mu'ammal ne kaha: Ham kahte hain: Un sab ne donon Eidain baghair azan aur iqamat ke padhain."
"229","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko donon Eidain ke din takbeer kahte suna. Amr ne kaha: Aur main nahin janta woh donon baton mein se kis ka irada karte hain, Allah Azza wa Jalla ka qaul: «فَإِذَا قَضَيْتُمْ مَنَاسِكَكُمْ فَاذْكُرُوا اللَّهَ» ya Us ka qaul: «وَاذْكُرُوا اللَّهَ فِي أَيَّامٍ مَعْدُودَاتٍ»."
"230","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi deta hun — ya unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas par gawahi deta hun — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eid ke din nikle, to namaz padhi phir khutba diya. To Aap ne gumaan farmaya ke auraton ne nahin suna to Aap teen ke baad un ke paas aae, to unhen naseehat farmai aur sadaqe par ubhara. To aurat bali aur anguthi dalne lagi, aur Bilal use lete aur apne kapde mein jama karte."
